{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06652","headline":"饯张七琚任宗城即环之季也同产八人俱以才名知 · 储光羲","name":"饯张七琚任宗城即环之季也同产八人俱以才名知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"他日曾游魏，魏家余趾存。\n可怜宫殿所，但见桑榆繁。\n此去拜新职，爲荣近故园。\n高阳八才子，况复在君门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}